>The </span><span begin="00:20.572" end="00:20.818">night's </span><span begin="00:20.818" end="00:20.942">so </span><span begin="00:20.942" end="00:21.131">young </span><span begin="00:21.131" end="00:21.380">and </span><span begin="00:21.380" end="00:21.570">I </span><span begin="00:21.570" end="00:21.820">wanna </span><span begin="00:21.820" end="00:22.004">have </span><span begin="00:22.004" end="00:22.373">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.080" end="00:24.320"><span begin="00:22.080" end="00:22.570">So </span><span begin="00:22.570" end="00:22.756">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.756" end="00:22.944">gonna </span><span begin="00:22.944" end="00:23.131">keep </span><span begin="00:23.131" end="00:23.320">goin' </span><span begin="00:23.320" end="00:23.509">till </span><span begin="00:23.509" end="00:23.692">the </span><span begin="00:23.692" end="00:23.884">party's </span><span begin="00:23.884" end="00:24.313">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.020" end="00:26.820"><span begin="00:24.020" end="00:24.504">You </span><span begin="00:24.504" end="00:24.694">know </span><span begin="00:24.694" end="00:24.878">I </span><span begin="00:24.878" end="00:25.070">love </span><span begin="00:25.070" end="00:25.192">women </span><span begin="00:25.192" end="00:25.380">but </span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:25.570">which </span><span begin="00:25.570" end="00:25.756">ones </span><span begin="00:25.756" end="00:25.944">gonna </span><span begin="00:25.944" end="00:26.254">control </span><span begin="00:26.254" end="00:26.815">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.520" end="00:28.384"><span begin="00:26.520" end="00:27.008">'Cuz </span><span begin="00:27.008" end="00:27.192">I </span><span begin="00:27.192" end="00:27.378">wanna </span><span begin="00:27.378" end="00:27.570">be </span><span begin="00:27.570" end="00:27.756">your </span><span begin="00:27.756" end="00:27.944">one </span><span begin="00:27.944" end="00:28.131">and </span><span begin